	"license": "MIT",
	"description": "Excel-like editable spreadsheet for Angular: in-cell editing, full keyboard navigation, rectangular range selection and a clipboard that round-trips with Excel. Accessible, themable through CSS variables and free of paid tiers. Part of the ng-hub-ui family.",
	"author": "Carlos Morcillo Fernández <carlos.morcillo@me.com> (https://www.carlosmorcillo.com)",
